<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <PackageId>ResponseResultHandler.AspNetCore</PackageId>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Title>Response Result Handler - ASP.NET Core</Title>
    <Version>16.1.0</Version>
    <Product>ResponseResultHandler.AspNetCore</Product>
    <Description>ASP.NET Core integration for ResponseResultHandler: turns results into Minimal API and MVC responses with RFC 9457 Problem Details, handles exceptions and unreadable requests in the same shape, and documents it all for OpenAPI.</Description>
    <PackageIcon>ResultHandlerIcon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageTags>aspnetcore minimal-api mvc problem-details rfc9457 openapi exception-handling result-pattern</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v16.1 - ToResult, ToActionResult and the enveloped variants throw ArgumentNullException for a null result; httpContext stays optional. See CHANGELOG.md.

v16.0 - Fix: handled 5xx are logged again on .NET 10; 1xx results throw instead of hanging the request; redirects and WithLocation write the Location header. New: 400s from BadHttpRequestException name the field, HttpRequestException is 502 and timeouts 504, public ResultExceptionHandlerOptions.Resolve, AddResultModelStateResponses() for MVC. See CHANGELOG.md.

v15.0 - Breaking (wire): the enveloped success body drops the always-empty "errors"/"fieldErrors" and is written as ResultEnvelope&lt;T&gt;, which ProducesEnveloped also documents (statusCode as an integer). New: AddResultExceptionHandler() for UseExceptionHandler(), and ToResultAsync/ToEnvelopedResultAsync/ToActionResultAsync/ToEnvelopedActionResultAsync for Task results. See CHANGELOG.md.

v14.0.1 - Fix: MVC validation failures keep their "errors" map when Problem Details services are registered; MVC failures apply CustomizeProblemDetails and use normal content negotiation.

v14.0 - Breaking: validation failures use the ASP.NET Core shape ("errors" is a field-to-messages map, "fieldErrors" removed). Failures go through IProblemDetailsService (CustomizeProblemDetails applies) and always carry instance and traceId. New: "code" extension from WithCode, AddResultProblemDetails() for framework errors, ProducesResultProblem(...), and ResultProblemDetails/ResultValidationProblemDetails OpenAPI schemas. See CHANGELOG.md for migration.

v13.3 - ProducesEnveloped&lt;T&gt;() / ProducesEnveloped(): documents the success body ToEnvelopedResult writes (OperationDataResult&lt;T&gt; or OperationResult) for OpenAPI, so API docs and generated clients see the envelope and its data type.

v13.2 - ProducesResultProblems(): one call on a route group documents the Problem Details responses (500, 401/403 for authorized endpoints, 422 for endpoints with a body) for OpenAPI, with no extra package dependency. See CHANGELOG.md for full details.</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <FrameworkReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.App" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="ResultHandler.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\ResultHandler\ResultHandler.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\ResultHandler\ResultHandlerIcon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git" Version="10.0.403">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers" Version="5.6.0">
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Update="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="10.0.401" />
    <PackageReference Update="SonarAnalyzer.CSharp" Version="10.35.0.4138" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
